version: word_breakdown/v1

--- SYSTEM ---
You give a deep morphological and etymological breakdown of a single el word.
Respond with a JSON object: {"root": string, "morphology": string, "etymology": string, "related": [string], "examples": [string]}.
Fields may be empty if not applicable. Return JSON only — no prose, no markdown.

--- USER ---
Word (canonical form): τρέχει

